---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---
<Layout title="我的书架" active="library"><div class="shell collection-page"><div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SPACE OF YOUR OWN</span><h1>把想读的，留给自己<span class="mint-dot">.</span></h1><p>收藏喜欢的文章，接着上次的思考。这里有你自己的阅读节奏。</p></div><div class="privacy-note"><Icon name="bookmark" size={18} /><p>收藏、已读和阅读进度仅保存在此浏览器，<strong>不同设备不会同步</strong>。清除浏览器数据也会清除这些记录。</p></div><div class="library-toolbar"><div class="library-tabs" role="group" aria-label="书架筛选"><button data-library-tab="bookmarked" class="active" aria-pressed="true">我的收藏</button><button data-library-tab="continue" aria-pressed="false">继续阅读</button><button data-library-tab="read" aria-pressed="false">已经读过</button></div><div class="backup-tools"><button id="export-reading" class="quiet-link"><Icon name="download" size={16} /> 导出记录</button><label class="quiet-link import-label" for="import-reading">导入记录<input id="import-reading" type="file" accept="application/json,.json" /></label></div></div><div class="cards-grid" id="library-results"></div><div class="empty-state" id="library-empty"><span class="empty-orbit" aria-hidden="true">✧</span><h2>书架空着，好奇心没有</h2><p>点击文章上的收藏图标，把值得重读的内容留在这里。</p><a class="button button-primary" href="/articles/">去发现一篇好文章 <Icon name="arrow" size={17} /></a></div></div><script>import '../scripts/library';</script></Layout>
